; Probe 3 of the caret arc: a second `^` at one level is `ambiguous_return`
; (AGENTS.md:108).
;
; `dl8 expand` and `dl8 compile` stop with one row,
; diagnostic(macrotime, <the (* ...) form>, ambiguous_return), written by the
; `syntax_diagnostic` rule in macrotime/1_caret.dl7.

(: Bad (* (: ^a int) (: ^b int)))
